# Git Pull Request

## Directives

- Use Guide skill `git-commit`, then Guide skill `git-push`.
- For branch delivery, reuse an existing pull request or create one using the
  selected pull-request policy and any repository template.
- Direct and multi-branch delivery do not require a pull request.

